report=['STATUS: DONE','COMMIT: '+sha,'CHANGED: 2 source/test files; 2 separate commits','OPEN: 0','BLOCKERS: none','---','','Independent branch from pinned '+C['base']+'. Test commit '+C['test']+' is deliberately baseline-red; fix commit '+sha+' changes only bypass_reason selection. Parent owns independent review and publication.','','Commands and evidence:','- Baseline regression: dedicated reason assertion fails, actual linker invocation vs admission-threshold (`red.log`).','- Scoped report suite: 100 passed, 0 failed (`green.log`).','- Fixture discriminator: dedicated fixture changes to cache-disabled while fixed expected admission-threshold remains; same assertion fails. Restored fixture: 1 passed, 0 failed (`discriminator.log`, `restored-green.log`).','- Exact-tip `'+command+'`: exit 0, workspace formatting, clippy, resource guard and tests (`gate.log`, `gate-exit.json`).','- Actual compiler proof: real rustc produces rlib; production admission-threshold event remains successful skipped in report details and grouping, summary skipped=1/errors=0 (`production-green.log`, evidence JSON).','','| Acceptance criterion | Proof |','| --- | --- |','| Dedicated Rust skip reason reaches report | Existing reason test and grouping test assert admission-threshold; real compiler proof |','| Legacy/default reason preserved | Skipped blank dedicated field falls back to linker invocation; both blank yields unknown |','| Passthrough reason stays independent | Passthrough event with nonempty skip_reason still selects linker invocation |','| Successful skips remain skips | Grouping assertions pin result/route=skipped, exit_code=0/count=1; real compiler summary confirms no errors |','| Separate commits and narrow fix | tests-only commit, then bypass_reason-only production diff |','','Oracle reasoning and executed discriminator are in oracle.md. Expected reason strings are literal policy outputs, independently fixed from fixture inputs. No new production test surface, process-global state, test hook, type or helper was added. Existing diagnostic summarization stays in the shared bypass_reason path. Size/shape: small existing function, no new abstraction, signature, suppression, or unrelated cleanup. No source from sibling redaction or interrupted-event fixes is present.','','Runner retains normal toolchain HOME/TMPDIR. CLI fixtures individually isolate HOME/config/cache/runtime. The private target is sequentially reused from the author-owned observability-003 target after previous gates ended; no other agent writes it. No local cargo-mutants: CI owns mutation testing. No unsupported-platform runtime claim. Published sibling tips and evidence are preserved.','','Workspace test summaries:']+['- '+x for x in re.findall(r'^test result:.*$',(A/'gate.log').read_text(),re.M)]
(A/'report.md').write_text('\n'.join(report)+'\n');print('READY '+str(A/'delivery.json'));print('SHA '+sha)
